    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>护甲（中甲），珍稀（需同调）</em></p><p>这套色彩鲜艳、花团锦簇的护甲铸成于 <strong>妖精荒野Feywild</strong> 之中，它充满着那个奇幻位面的诱人能量。</p><p>穿着这套护甲期间，你为防止陷入或结束 <strong>魅惑&amp;Reference[condition=charmed]</strong> 状态所做的豁免具有优势。</p><p>这套护甲具有3发充能。你可以消耗一发充能以用其施展法术<em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.RpBbOYseLZCFXaFY]{强迫术 Compulsion}</em>（豁免DC15）。这套护甲在每日黎明时分恢复[[/r 1d3]]发已消耗的充能数。</p><p>该护甲主要由皮条固定的金属护胸组成。尽管它并没有为四肢提供额外的防护，但其在保证着装者活动自由度的同时，为其生命器官提供了十分有效的保护效果。</p><p>This colorful, flowery armor was forged in the Feywild and is infused with that plane's captivating magic.</p><p>While wearing this armor, you have advantage on saving throws you make to avoid or end the &amp;Reference[condition=charmed] condition on yourself.</p><p>This armor has 3 charges. You can use an action to expend a charge to cast the @spell[Compulsion] spell (save DC 15) from this armor. The armor regains [[/r 1d3]] expended charges daily at dawn.</p><p>This armor consists of a fitted metal chest piece worn with supple leather. Although it leaves the legs and arms relatively unprotected, this armor provides good protection for the wearer's vital organs while leaving the wearer relatively unencumbered.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
